  "description": "*\"Am I a bad friend to you?\"*\n\nJi-Min, who is now in the same class as Ki-Jung, the source of all kinds of rumors and an object of avoidance. Contrary to expectations that it would be a difficult year, ordinary days pass by. Then one day, he spots Ki-Jung approaching a stray cat he was taking care of, and this becomes the opportunity for the two to gradually become closer...\n\nJi-Min skips school for the first time in his life and goes to a karaoke room. He knows it's an important time, but for some reason, he can't refuse to be with Ki-Jung.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
